WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:16,030
No injuries, no injuries

2
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:16,950
Made you worry

3
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,350
If you never come back

4
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,710
Someone is afraid that he is going to kill with a sword.

5
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:22,270
Tell me what you learned tonight

6
00:00:22,270 --> 00:00:23,590
I got it from Xiao Min’s team

7
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:25,390
Seized 5 corpses of high-level ferocious beasts

8
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:27,310
Plus a ten-million-level knotweed

9
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,430
follow our rules

10
00:00:28,430 --> 00:00:30,670
Deduct a fixed 5% deduction

11
00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:31,910
The rest of the harvest belongs to me

12
00:00:31,910 --> 00:00:32,830
Does it make sense to you?

13
00:00:32,830 --> 00:00:34,950
The whole city is yours alone, taking risks to deal with the harvest.

14
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,030
We have no opinion

15
00:00:36,030 --> 00:00:37,350
I can't have this five percent

16
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:40,390
The knotweed is worth tens of millions, and I feel ashamed that I have not been able to afford it.

17
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,750
The rules agreed upon will never invalidate the wet nurse's existence itself.

18
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:43,950
It’s the team’s confidence

19
00:00:43,950 --> 00:00:45,150
The team has no injuries and cannot use you.

20
00:00:45,150 --> 00:00:46,470
It's the biggest surname in the team

21
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:47,390
Hold it with peace of mind

22
00:00:47,390 --> 00:00:48,390
thank you captain

23
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:49,670
Everyone, hurry up and get some rest in your tent.

24
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:50,750
I will work tonight
